+  // The unmasked vendor/renderer strings are not the whole GPU fingerprint.
+  // Detectors also read the numeric limits (MAX_TEXTURE_SIZE,
+  // MAX_VERTEX_UNIFORM_VECTORS, MAX_VIEWPORT_DIMS, ...) and cross-check them
